category: Net
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Print the IP addresses in a given range"
ldesc: "prips is a tool that can be used to print all of the IP addresses in a given
range. It can enhance the usability of tools that are made to work on only one
host at a time (e.g. whois)."
skip:

homepage: https://devel.ringlet.net/sysutils/prips/
